:"https://api.github.com/repos/BTBON9090/parking-master-pro-v2.0/releases/assets/687646362","id":687646362,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQbb2Os4o_Kaa","name":"Parking-Master-Pro-0.28.1-win-x64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"BTBON9090","id":128127198,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6MQ3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128127198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090","html_url":"https://github.com/BTBON9090","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":146547332,"digest":"sha256:31674abe8e27564bed0b6929a58a031b152ca6cc4acfe59f442cb217119c18b9","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T06:51:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:52:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/BTBON9090/parking-master-pro-v2.0/releases/download/untagged-e1fd16a3f377191b8155/Parking-Master-Pro-0.28.1-win-x64.exe"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BTBON9090/parking-master-pro-v2.0/releases/assets/687646954","id":687646954,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQbb2Os4o_Kjq","name":"SHA256SUMS.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"BTBON9090","id":128127198,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6MQ3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128127198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090","html_url":"https://github.com/BTBON9090","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BTBON9090/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":526,"digest":"sha256:5f99423ae25c0f7a778468bdae9d85f5efb34daa5ad1514c330eb24a7e11bfc7","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T06:51:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:51:30Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/BTBON9090/parking-master-pro-v2.0/releases/download/untagged-e1fd16a3f377191b8155/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":null,"zipball_url":null,"body":"# 0.28.1 · 保存旅程，连通地图\n\n- 新增本机游戏进度：每5秒、退场及切后台自动保存，驾驶设置可手动保存，主菜单可继续上次驾驶。保留车型、地图、安全位置、奖励、停车完成项和考试成绩。恢复时停稳、N挡驻车；不恢复正在踩住的踏板、碰撞碎片或半途考核动作。主档损坏时尝试备份；地图修订或原位置被占用时回到该地图安全起点。\n- 触屏转向以落指处锚定当前方向，后续相对拖动；重新抓握不跳转，刻度继续随车速自适应。\n- 首页、选车、选图右上角加入设置。每个新版本首次显示变化说明，可在设置“关于我的介绍”再次查看。手机不再显示遮挡路面的键盘快捷提示。\n- Android 支持应用内下载更新、校验并打开系统安装器。校验大小、SHA256、包名、新版本号和应用签名，支持取消、失败重试。系统确认和首次安装权限仍由用户处理；覆盖安装保留本机进度。0.27.1及更早版本需要先从下载页安装本版本，之后才具备应用内安装能力。\n- 综合试验场说明上移，隐藏中央后视镜，保留左右镜；按实际位置识别考点，允许非顺序练习，离开区域停止套用旧项目规则。停靠项目仍要求在指定位置停稳。\n- 青岚山路面采样剪枝降低CPU工作量，保持渲染三角面接触；护栏检查整段交叉关系并留出路口。修复宽停车坪与窄山路相接时路面支撑高度不一致。\n- 云顶路线加入不同半径回头弯与长弧，山顶可发现罗盘彩蛋。整车停入升降台后可往返云顶与山腹，80秒游戏升降动画可跳过；山腹涵洞通向城市。升降机与地下通道是当前框架内的程序化场景。\n- 地库南端新增双圈螺旋坡道，B1直达B3，原东侧逐层坡道保留。城东通道分别连接地库B1和高速服务区，驶入后自动切换地图并保存上一张地图的完成项；到达后重新起步。\n\n存档保存在当前设备，不是云同步。卸载或清除应用数据会删除；不同设备不会自动共享。当前开放地图/车辆没有新增付费解锁。\n\n验证与边界见 docs/round43/VALIDATION.md。桌面游戏、数值回归与Android模拟器验证分别记录；不以模拟器结果承诺手机帧率、温度或厂商安装器行为。车辆资产与正式驱动算法本轮未更换；Mac/Windows安装包未签名，iOS仍为工程ZIP，不提供IPA。\n\n0.28.0是未更新公开清单的候选包；独立截图发现升降井壁遮挡第三人称镜头，因此最终发行版为0.28.1。第三人称靠近升降台时隐藏井壁外壳供观察，驾驶舱保留井壁，物理碰撞不变。\n"}